WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.644 --> 00:00:16.335
"Do you think it's the Sovereign's Staff?"

2
00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:17.356
Perda asked.

3
00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:22.280
Zann and Perda were walking through the campus of First City University.

4
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.382
They were on their way to watch an invisible airball game.

5
00:00:26.363 --> 00:00:30.066
Zann thought about the spy fly message he'd just received from Zella.

6
00:00:30.086 --> 00:00:31.968
"I doubt it.

7
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.461
Zella's village is probably just as boring as Swamp Bottom."

8
00:00:36.482 --> 00:00:37.862
"Yeah," Perda said.

9
00:00:37.882 --> 00:00:42.304
"Zella and her friends were pretty excited about finding that cave.

10
00:00:43.505 --> 00:00:46.346
Every stick and stone probably looks like a relic to them."

11
00:00:47.226 --> 00:00:50.788
Zann remembered being an overexcited small-town kid himself.

12
00:00:51.668 --> 00:00:55.669
Back in Swamp Bottom, he'd dreamed of adventure—just like Zella.

13
00:00:55.689 --> 00:00:58.891
"I guess we can mention it to my parents later.

14
00:00:58.911 --> 00:01:02.344
I don't want to miss that airball game," he said.

15
00:01:02.364 --> 00:01:06.846
"By the way, Zella said she got the idea to send a video fly from you."

16
00:01:08.107 --> 00:01:10.528
He smiled at Perda, feeling proud of her.

17
00:01:11.568 --> 00:01:13.269
She was really clever with magic.

18
00:01:14.169 --> 00:01:19.551
She'd figured out how to transform an ordinary spy fly into a video message carrier.

19
00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:22.733
She was always coming up with good ideas like that.

20
00:01:22.753 --> 00:01:26.174
"Why are you staring at me like that?"

21
00:01:27.014 --> 00:01:28.255
Perda poked him in the arm.

22
00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:31.036
Zann jumped, feeling slightly flustered.

23
00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:35.559
"Sorry. I was just— hey, look, a message moth."

24
00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.642
The moth fluttered over and landed on his hand.

25
00:01:39.302 --> 00:01:40.463
Perda leaned closer.

26
00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:42.125
"Is it from Zella?"

27
00:01:42.145 --> 00:01:47.209
"Yes." Zann read the message, and his eyes widened.

28
00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.072
"She says the staff disappeared!"

29
00:01:50.092 --> 00:01:53.174
"Huh?" Perda said in surprise.

30
00:01:53.915 --> 00:01:55.556
Zann scanned the message again.

31
00:01:55.576 --> 00:01:59.440
"Zella and her brother went to tell some adults what they'd found.

32
00:02:00.356 --> 00:02:03.758
Their friend stood guard outside the cave entrance the whole time they were gone.

33
00:02:04.298 --> 00:02:06.720
But when they went back in, the staff was gone."

34
00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:09.641
"That's strange," Perda said.

35
00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:12.803
"Maybe they got confused and went down the wrong tunnel."

36
00:02:12.823 --> 00:02:15.945
"Maybe," Zann said.

37
00:02:15.965 --> 00:02:20.487
"But now I'm thinking we should tell my parents and Boz about this right away, just in case.

38
00:02:21.068 --> 00:02:23.789
They were more interested in Zella's cave than I thought they'd be."

39
00:02:24.449 --> 00:02:25.730
He touched his red hair.

40
00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:29.012
"They've been studying the Mask of Zanta recently.

41
00:02:29.672 --> 00:02:34.414
A few researchers want to try to piece that relic back together, but others think it's too dangerous."

42
00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:38.356
"Are you thinking about how you're related to old King Zanta?"

43
00:02:38.556 --> 00:02:39.176
Perda asked.

44
00:02:39.917 --> 00:02:43.398
That was another thing Perda was good at—guessing what Zann was thinking.

45
00:02:44.399 --> 00:02:44.879
He nodded.

46
00:02:44.899 --> 00:02:48.100
"It's weird being related to someone like that."

47
00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.961
"I bet.

48
00:02:50.441 --> 00:02:51.862
Zanta was super evil.

49
00:02:52.722 --> 00:02:53.923
Even worse than Morb."

50
00:02:54.903 --> 00:02:56.724
Perda glanced across the campus.

51
00:02:57.524 --> 00:03:01.466
At the far end, an enormous clear cube floated above the ground.

52
00:03:02.526 --> 00:03:04.027
It was half filled with water.

53
00:03:04.908 --> 00:03:10.170
In the middle was a small island where a tall, thin man was pacing between a cot and

54
00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:10.690
a table.

55
00:03:11.611 --> 00:03:15.212
Morb noticed the kids staring and glowered at them.

56
00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:17.794
But Zann didn't feel scared of Morb.

57
00:03:18.554 --> 00:03:22.396
He even felt a little sorry for him, stuck in that clear prison.

58
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:28.670
Then he remembered how many times Morb had tried to take over or destroy Magica.

59
00:03:29.431 --> 00:03:31.672
Suddenly he didn't feel sorry for him at all!

60
00:03:31.692 --> 00:03:36.114
"Let's go to the lab," Zann said, grabbing Perda's hand.

61
00:03:36.134 --> 00:03:38.875
"Zap!" Splash!

62
00:03:39.395 --> 00:03:43.937
They landed in a puddle of bright pink rain near the entrance to his parents' lab.

63
00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:47.759
"Drat," Zann muttered, magically drying his shoes.

64
00:03:48.359 --> 00:03:50.400
Perda was already hurrying into the lab.

65
00:03:51.232 --> 00:03:56.016
When Zann followed her, the only person there was an intern whose name he couldn't remember.

66
00:03:56.036 --> 00:04:00.540
"Your parents and the others got called to the palace," the intern said.

67
00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.401
"I'm not sure why."

68
00:04:02.421 --> 00:04:05.804
"Thanks." Zann looked at Perda.

69
00:04:06.585 --> 00:04:07.746
"I wonder what's going on.

70
00:04:08.466 --> 00:04:11.649
Mom and Dad didn't say anything about a meeting at the palace today."

71
00:04:11.669 --> 00:04:14.051
"There's one way to find out."

72
00:04:14.911 --> 00:04:16.052
Perda grabbed his hand.

73
00:04:16.072 --> 00:04:20.256
"Zap!" They landed in front of the palace doors.

74
00:04:21.444 --> 00:04:22.926
"Oh, hello, kids."

75
00:04:23.706 --> 00:04:24.767
The guard looked worried.

76
00:04:24.787 --> 00:04:27.950
"Is Queen Venna expecting you?

77
00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:31.092
It's, uh, a little busy here today."

78
00:04:31.112 --> 00:04:33.994
"We heard my parents are here," Zann said.

79
00:04:34.495 --> 00:04:36.857
"We have important information to tell them."

80
00:04:37.998 --> 00:04:39.379
"Oh, I see."

81
00:04:40.099 --> 00:04:41.160
The guard waved them in.

82
00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.403
"I think everyone is in the throne room."

83
00:04:45.323 --> 00:04:47.025
Zann and Perda hurried inside.

84
00:04:47.045 --> 00:04:52.433
"See? Sometimes it's nice being famous," Perda whispered with a smile.

85
00:04:53.353 --> 00:04:54.854
Zann tried to smile back.

86
00:04:55.374 --> 00:04:56.834
But he was feeling nervous now.

87
00:04:57.335 --> 00:04:58.235
What was going on?

88
00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:01.336
When they reached the throne room, it was deserted.

89
00:05:01.356 --> 00:05:02.977
"Now what?"

90
00:05:03.277 --> 00:05:03.817
Perda said.

91
00:05:03.837 --> 00:05:07.139
"Let's find Yog," Zann suggested.

92
00:05:07.159 --> 00:05:10.360
"If something important is happening, he'll tell us."

93
00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:13.961
They rushed to the office where the young man worked.

94
00:05:14.822 --> 00:05:16.742
When they arrived, he was just coming out.

95
00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:18.783
"We heard my parents were called here.

96
00:05:19.003 --> 00:05:19.664
Is something wrong?"

97
00:05:20.044 --> 00:05:20.584
Zann said.

98
00:05:21.552 --> 00:05:22.593
Yog hesitated.

99
00:05:22.613 --> 00:05:25.534
"I'm not supposed to tell anyone.

100
00:05:26.675 --> 00:05:27.895
But I'll take you to your parents."

101
00:05:29.296 --> 00:05:32.297
The kids followed Yog through the palace to the safe room.

102
00:05:32.978 --> 00:05:36.239
That was where the most powerful and dangerous relics were kept.

103
00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:41.382
It had only one entrance, which was protected by powerful Shield spells.

104
00:05:42.322 --> 00:05:45.524
Two burly guards stood outside the door all the time.

105
00:05:46.544 --> 00:05:52.447
Zann's parents, Nax and Asta, were outside the room, along with Zann’s grandfather, Boz.

106
00:05:53.148 --> 00:05:56.249
Queen Venna and several other important people were there too.

107
00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:57.830
"What's going on?"

108
00:05:58.171 --> 00:05:59.311
Zann asked his parents.

109
00:05:59.891 --> 00:06:00.972
His mother looked grim.

110
00:06:00.992 --> 00:06:03.033
"It's the Mask of Zanta."

111
00:06:04.354 --> 00:06:05.635
Zann's father nodded.

112
00:06:05.655 --> 00:06:10.157
"It was in the safe room this morning when we stopped by to do some experiments.

113
00:06:10.998 --> 00:06:15.240
But when another researcher went in just now to check something, it was gone!"

114
00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:17.049
Zann gasped.

115
00:06:17.969 --> 00:06:19.630
"Gone? How?"

116
00:06:20.651 --> 00:06:22.592
"We don't know," Queen Venna said.

117
00:06:22.612 --> 00:06:24.814
"The guards were here all day.

118
00:06:25.815 --> 00:06:29.737
The only people they let in were a couple of researchers and the cleaning person."

119
00:06:30.638 --> 00:06:32.859
Zann and Perda exchanged another look.

120
00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.761
Then Zann took a deep breath.

121
00:06:37.842 --> 00:06:42.105
"Speaking of Zanta and disappearing relics.

122
00:06:43.066 --> 00:06:45.367
We have something to tell you
